  body: Tap to shove a cart along the track. Hold to push or pull it with you. Place
    treasure into cargo carts to haul it around. Drive carts have a seat — look at
    the side to ride. Call posts summon carts; unload stations dump cargo.
  keybindHint: '[{ContextualInteract}] Tap to shove  Hold [{ContextualInteract}] Push
    [{SecondaryInteract}] Place in cart'
